      "typical_award_size": "The County is not an active issuer; it approves conduit issuances under Section 147(f) for projects in the unincorporated area or where a joint powers authority needs host approval. Examples: Resolution 2025-22 (February 4, 2025) approving up to $20,000,000 of CMFA multifamily housing revenue bonds for Rancho Las Bolsas Apartments, Temecula area (Jamboree, 55 units, 26 PSH); Resolution 2025-15 (January 28, 2025) approving up to $80,000,000 of bonds for mobile home park acquisitions including Oasis Villas; CSCDA bonds for a Wildomar project (October 2023); CalPFA educational facility bonds (June 9, 2026).",
      "per_unit_cap": "Not applicable.",
      "affordability_requirement": "Bond regulatory agreements (20% at 50% AMI or 40% at 60% AMI) under CDLAC rules.",
